  "solution": "Given equation: (42 ÷ 7) × 5 = 30 × 120 ÷ (10 + 5 × 2).\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 10 and 5\n\nGiven: (42 ÷ 7) × 5 = 30 × 120 ÷ (10 + 5 × 2) \n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**42 ÷ 7**__) × 10 = 30 × 120 ÷ (5 + __**10 × 2**__) \n\n⇒ __**6 × 10**__ = 30 × 120 ÷ (__**5 + 20**__) \n\n⇒ 60 = 30 × __**120 ÷ 25 **__\n\n⇒ 60 = __**30 × 4.8**__\n\n⇒ 60 ≠ 144\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) 2 and 5\n\nGiven: (42 ÷ 7) × 5 = 30 × 120 ÷ (10 + 5 × 2) \n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**42 ÷ 7**__) × 2 = 30 × 120 ÷ (10 + __**2 × 5**__) \n\n⇒ __**6 × 2**__ = 30 × 120 ÷ (__**10 + 10**__) \n\n⇒ 12 = 30 × __**120 ÷ 20**__ \n\n⇒ 12 = __**30 × 6**__\n\n⇒ 12 ≠ 180\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) 7 and 2\n\nGiven: (42 ÷ 7) × 5 = 30 × 120 ÷ (10 + 5 × 2) \n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**42 ÷ 2**__) × 5 = 30 × 120 ÷ (10 + __**5 × 7**__) \n\n⇒ __**21 × 5**__ = 30 × 120 ÷ (__**10 + 35**__) \n\n⇒ 105 = __**30 × 120 ÷ 45**__ \n\n⇒ 105 ≠ 80\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 4) 10 and 30**\n\nGiven: (42 ÷ 7) × 5 = 30 × 120 ÷ (10 + 5 × 2) \n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**42 ÷ 7**__) × 5 = 10 × 120 ÷ (30 + __**5 × 2**__) \n\n⇒ __**6 × 5**__ = 10 × 120 ÷ (__**30 + 10**__) \n\n⇒ 30 = 10 × __**120 ÷ 40**__ \n\n⇒ 30 = __**10 × 3**__\n\n⇒** 30 = 30**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
